      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "DETACHED RESIDENTIAL PROPERTY, WITH OUTBUILDINGS, ON C.8 ACRES OF GOOD QUALITY AGRICULTURAL LAND.\r\n\r\nDavis Auctioneers bring to the market this traditional farmhouse on C. 8 acres of good quality agricultural lands, situated just 5 minutes from the village of Ballynacarrigy. The property is brilliantly located, just a 20-minute drive to Mullingar, with Ballymahon and Center Parcs Longford Forest Holiday Resort a 10-15 minute drive away.\r\n\r\nIn need of some care and repair, as well as modernising, the c.175m2 residential accommodation comprises of a sitting room, living room, kitchen-dining room, utility, four bedrooms, a bathroom and a WC (on the ground floor). This impressive holding also incorporates agricultural outbuildings, workshops, as well as a spacious yard and cattle handling facilities.\r\n\r\nVacant Property Refurbishment Grants are available for this type of property subject to the terms and conditions.\r\n\r\nPlease call to us at 53 Main Street, Longford, or phone us on 043-33 50555 to arrange your viewing.\r\n\r\nEIRCODE: N91 PC53\r\n\r\nContained in and part of Folios: WH1162 & WH1160."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Residence in need of repair and modernising on c.8 acres\r\n\r\nDetached Agricultural Outbuildings\r\n\r\nLarge Hayshed\r\n\r\nYard and cattle handling facilities\r\n\r\nVacant Property Refurbishment Grant available \r\n\r\nSEAI Home Energy Grants available\r\n\r\nWalking Distance to the Royal Canal Greenway\r\n\r\n5 minute drive to Ballynacarrigy\r\n\r\nJust a few minutes drive to Longford, Ballymahon and Edgeworthstown\r\n\r\nJust 20 minutes from Center Parcs Longford Forest Holiday Resort\r\n\r\nNumerous education facilities within 15 minutes\r\n\r\nSuits owner occupiers/first time buyers\r\n\r\nWater & Septic Tank \r\n\r\nOil fired heating\r\n\r\n35 minutes To Athlone\r\n\r\n20 minutes to Mullingar\r\n\r\n15 minutes to Ballymahon \r\n\r\n10 minutes to Abbeyshrule\r\n\r\n1hr 15 mins to Dublin\r\n\r\nIdeal holiday home opportunity"
      },
      {
